rix.\n\nWe can see that $A$ has $3$ pivots in the $2$nd, $4$th and $5$th columns:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -4 & 3 & -3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & -3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, the only non-pivot columns are the $1$st and $3$rd columns." 13194139534117 17592186045417 true] [17592186410772 1058 #edb/ref 17592186410775 13194139534117 17592186045417 true] [17592186410772 1062 #uuid "30f26997-9e49-5db0-9f88-9376de7a0b7c" 13194139534117 17592186045417 true] [17592186410772 1063 #edb/ref 17592186402461 13194139534117 17592186045417 true] [17592186410773 1062 #uuid "4d58ea96-3315-5ccd-a989-6430f4d9b8fb" 13194139534117 17592186045417 true] [17592186410773 1063 #edb/ref 17592186410771 13194139534117 17592186045417 true] [17592186410774 1058 #edb/ref 17592186410772 13194139534117 17592186045417 true] [17592186410774 1062 #uuid "9f3fb4e7-d2df-5336-aacb-83aad5e72280" 13194139534117 17592186045417 true] [17592186410774 1063 #edb/ref 17592186124905 13194139534117 17592186045417 true] [17592186410775 1058 #edb/ref 17592186410773 13194139534117 17592186045417 true] [17592186410775 1062 #uuid "acf78879-b468-5dc7-b376-c889a5d49184" 13194139534117 17592186045417 true] [17592186410775 1063 #edb/ref 17592186342043 13194139534117 17592186045417 true] [17592186410776 1058 #edb/ref 17592186410774 13194139534117 17592186045417 true] [17592186410776 1062 #uuid "c53be52e-3dd0-549d-8ced-3218bf1d3d25" 13194139534117 17592186045417 true] [17592186410776 1063 #edb/ref 17592186323677 13194139534117 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"activity-620653fd-8e7d-5de8-beb7-37d1715ab5f2" 17592186410764 "answer-1d3d7552-73fd-5a30-adca-213fce95daf3" 17592186410765 "answer-2c231bf1-1c62-5bb0-a5af-80fd235dc05d" 17592186410766 "answer-88eecdfd-f245-5138-93d4-a347d38063c5" 17592186410767 "answer-a582f1d6-9082-5ca9-8a15-8892198e09a8" 17592186410768 "answer-ab2f5437-3869-5765-88a5-9a58e75de19b" 17592186410769 "answer-field-0ec2a6fc-f001-5e94-83d4-c400fba8593b" 17592186410770 "ques